= The Clone Army

Following the assassin's trail, Obi-Wan Kenobi has found a world erased from the Jedi Archives: **Kamino**. Its cloners have built an army of clone troopers for the Republic, ordered a decade ago by the late Jedi Master Sifo-Dyas. Two hundred thousand units are ready, with a million more on the way. The template is a bounty hunter named Jango Fett, the same man who hired Padmé's assassin.

The Jedi Council is deeply disturbed. The Chancellor calls it "providential".
